📌 How to Cite This Project

Thank you for using the Urban Heat Island (UHI) Analyzer!

If you use this tool in your research, publication, or project, please cite it using the metadata provided in the repository’s `CITATION.cff` file.

👉 GitHub automatically generates citation formats (APA, BibTeX, etc.) from this file.

### Quick Steps to Cite:

1. Go to the GitHub repository:
   https://github.com/suyogautam/Global-UHI-Analyzer-

2. Click on **"Cite this repository"** (usually found on the right sidebar or under the "About" section).

3. Copy your preferred citation format (APA, BibTeX, Chicago, etc.).

