### Manual Citation (BibTeX Example)

```bibtex
@software{gautam_uhi_analyzer_2026,
  author = {Gautam, Suyog},
  title = {Urban Heat Island (UHI) Analyzer},
  year = {2026},
  url = {https://github.com/suyogautam/Global-UHI-Analyzer-}
}
```

